{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12704","headline":"潓阳亭作 · 元结","name":"潓阳亭作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问吾常讌息，泉上何处好。\n独有潓阳亭，令人可终老。\n前轩临潓泉，凭几漱清流。\n外物自相扰，渊渊还复休。\n有时出东户，更欲檐下坐。\n非我意不行，石渠能留我。\n峰石若鳞次，欹垂复旋回。\n爲我引潓泉，泠泠檐下来。\n天寒宜泉温，泉寒宜天暑。\n谁到潓阳亭，其心肯思去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}